diff --git a/.changeset/quiet-owls-age.md b/.changeset/quiet-owls-age.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..7e8b4e2
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.changeset/quiet-owls-age.md
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+---
+"saleor-dashboard": patch
+---
+
+Added age-restricted products: staff can flag a product as age-restricted on the product page and see its "N+" label in the product list and on the product page. Staff with MANAGE_SETTINGS can set the store-wide minimum age and the shop time zone in store settings. Superusers can view and change a customer's date of birth, and other staff with MANAGE_USERS see whether a customer is age eligible. Draft orders show the new "customer is not eligible to buy age-restricted products" error. Age-restricted products stay visible with their "N+" label in collection and category product lists, product pickers, order and draft order lines, discount rule and voucher product pickers and summaries, and global search.
